<topic xml:id="sle16-upgrade-paths"
 role="reference" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <!-- can be changed via merge in the assembly -->
   <title>Supported upgrade paths to &productnameshort;&nbsp;&productnumber;</title>
    <!--add author's email address-->
    <meta name="maintainer" content="cwickert@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
    <abstract><!-- can be changed via merge in the assembly -->
      <para>
       This section lists the upgrade paths for &productname; &productnumber;.
      </para>
    </abstract>
  </info>

  <para>
    &productname; &productnumber; allows upgrades from the following products:
  </para>

  <variablelist>
    <varlistentry os="sles;sleha;sles4sap">
      <term>&productnameshort; 15 SP5, SP6, and SP7</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Upgrades from &productname; 15 SP5, SP6 and SP7 to 16 are performed using the
          Distribution Migration System as covered in this article.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry os="sles;sleha;sles4sap">
      <term>&productnameshort; 16.0</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Upgrades within the &productname; 16 family are performed using
          <command>zypper migration</command>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry os="sles">
      <term>&slerta; 15 SP5, SP6 and SP7</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Upgrades from &slert; 15 SP5, SP6 and SP7 to 16 are performed using the
          Distribution Migration System as covered in this article.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry os="sles">
      <term>&slm; 6.2</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Upgrades from &slm; 6.2 to the &productname; 16 family are performed using
          <command>tranactional-update migration</command>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry os="sles">
      <term>&leap; 16.1</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Upgrades from &leap; to the &productname; 16 family are performed using
          <command>zypper migration</command> or the Distribution Migration System.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
  </variablelist>
  <para>
    Other products and versions are not supported. Refer to the documentation of your product to
    upgrade it to a supported version first.
  </para>
</topic>
